  "notice": "Unqualified candidate fit study. The upright battery is rotated 180 degrees; the controller is centered above it on a fixed electrical plate. Four slotted-jaw/hand-knob concepts move with the open tray, but the pack flange, grip, captive hardware and secondary locks are unmodeled and do not yet secure the battery. After rated isolation and verification, unbolt the battery leads first, then unlock and extract the tray. The animation does not release the clamps or lift the pack. Terminal offsets, contactor rating, guide rating, seat-to-guide transfer, restraint and stability remain HOLD; no fabrication or electrical qualification.",
